BT 1 0 0 1 0 62 Tm .2921 Tw 12 TL /F1 10 Tf 0 0 0 rg (The class itself is just an abstract description. Taking cars as an example, I know the concept of cars, and when we) Tj T* 0 Tw 2.384957 Tw (really want to use cars, we need real cars. The use of classes is similar. We will not only use this abstract) Tj T* 0 Tw .263182 Tw (description, but need to produce a concrete object based on this description. This process is called ) Tj /F2 10 Tf (Instantiation of) Tj T* 0 Tw 1.110273 Tw (the class) Tj /F1 10 Tf (, abbreviated as instantiation, and the concrete object produced by instantiation is called ) Tj /F2 10 Tf (Instance) Tj /F1 10 Tf (. The) Tj T* 0 Tw .946123 Tw (class itself does not have data, and instantiation produces an instance based on the information described by the) Tj T* 0 Tw (class and gives the instance specific data.) Tj T* ET
