BT 1 0 0 1 0 98 Tm .338705 Tw 12 TL /F1 10 Tf 0 0 0 rg (Native functions usually do not need to be used outside the C file, so they are generally declared as ) Tj /F3 10 Tf (static) Tj /F1 10 Tf ( types.) Tj T* 0 Tw .096095 Tw (Use the ) Tj /F3 10 Tf (be_top) Tj /F1 10 Tf ( function to get the absolute index of the top of the virtual stack \() Tj /F3 10 Tf (top) Tj /F1 10 Tf ( value\), which is the capacity of) Tj T* 0 Tw .270742 Tw (the stack. We can call ) Tj /F3 10 Tf (be_top) Tj /F1 10 Tf ( before the native function performs the virtual stack operation, at this time the virtual) Tj T* 0 Tw .106005 Tw (stack capacity is equal to the real parameter amount. For the ) Tj /F3 10 Tf (add) Tj /F1 10 Tf ( function, we need two parameters to participate in) Tj T* 0 Tw .09155 Tw (the operation, so check whether the number of parameters is 2 in the fourth line \() Tj /F3 10 Tf (top) Tj ( ) Tj (==) Tj ( ) Tj (2) Tj /F1 10 Tf (\). And we need to check) Tj T* 0 Tw 1.489672 Tw (whether the two parameters are both numeric types, so we need to call the ) Tj /F3 10 Tf (be_isnumber) Tj /F1 10 Tf ( function to check. If) Tj T* 0 Tw .527584 Tw (everything is correct, the parameters will be taken out of the virtual stack, then the calculation result will be pushed) Tj T* 0 Tw 1.168273 Tw (onto the stack, and finally returned using ) Tj /F3 10 Tf (be_return) Tj /F1 10 Tf (. If the parameter verification fails, ) Tj /F3 10 Tf (be_return_nil) Tj /F1 10 Tf ( will be) Tj T* 0 Tw (called to return the value of ) Tj /F3 10 Tf (nil) Tj /F1 10 Tf (.) Tj T* ET
