BT 1 0 0 1 0 50 Tm .590829 Tw 12 TL /F1 10 Tf 0 0 0 rg (The compile-time construction technology is mainly implemented by ) Tj /F4 10 Tf (coc) Tj /F1 10 Tf ( which is located in the ) Tj /F4 10 Tf (coc/coc) Tj /F1 10 Tf ( path of the) Tj T* 0 Tw -0.000328 Tw (interpreter source code directory. ) Tj /F4 10 Tf (coc) Tj /F1 10 Tf ( Tool is used to generate constant strings, and constant objects as C code, and) Tj T* 0 Tw .118637 Tw (will be compiled into constants when the interpreter is compiled. In principle, the ) Tj /F4 10 Tf (coc) Tj /F1 10 Tf ( tool will generate code from the) Tj T* 0 Tw .670273 Tw (declaration information of the constant object \(in accordance with a specific format\). The process will automatically) Tj T* 0 Tw (calculate the Hash value and generate the Hash table.) Tj T* ET
